": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=InbjTaByBUAQ7kNvwF88AFA&_nc_oc=Adq2oEz8R99FXkqz1s7iPagUFp86qNly-Cr_0whHsNQjfxYQscACCZvMre0peMduMzQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO_NeIUvUe596KKgpCEs4BeEecXkQb1E0yEr60-QYOKHQ&oe=6ADCD79B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AtaGZTkofDgQ7kNvwGh7idm&_nc_oc=AdprXXDNpEVz1xsJbDaZ2LGpZW_-ls2n5aLR-UTIwTEPwYpuLNm0bOwOS7pc4TTON0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNG6m1p6of88RX92vmy0b6Dtvun2epMWL8Sb4I6WhmyDg&oe=6ADCC7E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aSmyHj03OtsQ7kNvwFS7Ezf&_nc_oc=AdrQH1s35ebh42Z6P0YH38dx73kdyle4xeKraL53JeYXZF-az_9c-sLDkmgiGUfuEOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMrUaDbGPLpGADK8slB9y_lBfati4ETK3YbSMM7qb8QEQ&oe=6ADCB4AF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FpX4XaRYt3IQ7kNvwGnQzjb&_nc_oc=Adp3aH3Nmuelooz2SiKpfIshnnKaoEvsgBc-ndhjFMEO0GKcGf9NUEOAnFdVRqZHo3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNj9X5yvNZcP-eLuGAUWYKvUSViAzrVAp2sY1ln3y7oIw&oe=6ADCB452"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bwyePBJvD0UQ7kNvwHTJNLt&_nc_oc=Adphe6yor8qPiUE6ZMKxew91iIsJa8Noj2A1F1GaJ2q9WZYfu7QE2_xqGzlrWwwf7ZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM5OGyY9NoK3iW6jyOp5OGiVpuFG8pFSFbhNUzekkeg_A&oe=6ADCBDFD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a